pub.dev only accepts app_dart 0.2.1 from a run that a `push` or `workflow_dispatch` event starts, and a `release` event started this run on `refs/tags/app_dart/v0.2.1`; start the publish workflow from tag pushes (`on: push`) instead of `on: release`, or publish it with `gh workflow run publish.yml --repo example/pub-dev-release-tags --ref app_dart/v0.2.1`
